{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3d6310d3-da1f-8abc-a9b9-f1047cdfc5f2",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T12:53:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Amara Tran",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:51:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon. My name is Amara Tran. I am calling about my water and sewer bill. It came last week and, frankly, the number is not sensible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:51:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take a look. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:51:18-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "127 Kingston Avenue, in the Historic Hill. A new meter was installed at my house last month. Before that, my bills were quite steady. Now this one is almost double. On the other hand, I have not changed anything. Same me, same laundry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:51:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me pull up the account. Bear with me one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:51:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. I will wait. [pause] Hello? Oh, excuse me. I have muted my own telephone. I pressed the wrong button. Can you hear me now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:51:46-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I hear you fine. No problem. Okay, I see the meter exchange on the account last month. What's happening is the first bill after a swap sometimes mixes the old meter's final reading with the new meter's starting reading, and that can throw the usage off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:52:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it is a mistake on your side, on the other hand not a mistake of mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:52:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It looks like the usage on this bill is higher than it should be for the number of days, so I'd want the meter reading verified and the bill corrected. I'll flag it for a review."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:52:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Then I would like a corrected bill mailed to me, please. Paper, in the mailbox. I do not trust screens for this kind of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:52:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we'll mail the corrected one once it's adjusted. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:52:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. In the meantime, can you send me a duplicate copy of the current bill by email? I want to keep it for my records, to compare with the new one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:52:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can do that. What email address do you want it sent to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:52:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One moment. [pause] Hello? Oh, I did it again. I muted the phone a second time. These buttons are too close together. Are you still there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:52:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still here. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:53:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I believe the email on file is the correct one. On the other hand, if you see an old one, please tell me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:53:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look. Okay, there's one on the account. I'll send the copy to that one, and you should see it later today. If it's not in your inbox, check your junk folder."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:53:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. And if the corrected bill is not arriving, what should I do? I would prefer not to call five times."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Give it a week or two. If nothing's in your mailbox by then, call back and mention the meter review. Do you want to leave a callback number in case the meter folks have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:53:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0176."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:53:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0176. I've put the note on the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:53:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Tony. That is all. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:53:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Tran. Take care."
    }
  ],
